WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.503 --> 00:00:18.504
going to help Ello ourselves?"

2
00:00:18.804 --> 00:00:19.464
Gliss cried.

3
00:00:19.484 --> 00:00:20.624
"But how?

4
00:00:21.085 --> 00:00:23.165
He's trapped on Skellia, remember?"

5
00:00:23.185 --> 00:00:26.646
"We went to Skellia before," Perda said.

6
00:00:26.666 --> 00:00:28.186
"We can go there again."

7
00:00:28.206 --> 00:00:30.587
"You mean through the vortex?"

8
00:00:30.987 --> 00:00:33.748
Zann felt a shiver of fear, but he shook it off.

9
00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:35.460
"You're right.

10
00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:37.241
It's the only way to help him."

11
00:00:37.261 --> 00:00:41.063
"We've traveled through the vortex before," Perda said.

12
00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:48.185
"In fact, we've spent more time in the vortex than anyone we know—except for Wyssa and your parents."

13
00:00:49.346 --> 00:00:50.787
She looked at Darb and Gliss.

14
00:00:51.267 --> 00:00:52.587
"We can do this."

15
00:00:53.848 --> 00:00:56.449
Zann smiled, impressed by Perda's courage.

16
00:00:56.469 --> 00:00:58.750
"Okay," Zann said.

17
00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:03.192
"Should we try to use the wormhole in Wormwood, or—" "Stop!"

18
00:01:03.372 --> 00:01:04.092
Gliss exclaimed.

19
00:01:05.004 --> 00:01:08.686
"We can't just rush off through the closest wormhole."

20
00:01:08.706 --> 00:01:12.868
"Again," Darb added, tickling Zing under his chin.

21
00:01:14.009 --> 00:01:14.949
Perda frowned.

22
00:01:14.969 --> 00:01:17.810
"Are you two saying you don't want to help Ello?"

23
00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:21.792
"He saved us when we got stuck on Skellia," Zann said.

24
00:01:22.593 --> 00:01:23.813
Gliss shook her head.

25
00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:25.814
"That's not what I'm saying at all."

26
00:01:26.295 --> 00:01:28.756
Her voice was shaky, but she sounded certain.

27
00:01:29.824 --> 00:01:35.748
"I'm saying that if we're going into the vortex, we need to be sensible about how we do

28
00:01:35.808 --> 00:01:38.350
it." "Okay then," Zann said.

29
00:01:38.370 --> 00:01:40.191
"So what should we do?"

30
00:01:41.172 --> 00:01:42.093
Darb spoke up.

31
00:01:42.453 --> 00:01:43.194
"I have an idea.

32
00:01:43.674 --> 00:01:46.216
What about that guidelink Zann's parents invented?"

33
00:01:47.296 --> 00:01:48.097
Perda gasped.

34
00:01:48.517 --> 00:01:50.078
"What a great idea!

35
00:01:50.479 --> 00:01:53.181
They said it might help people navigate the vortex."

36
00:01:53.201 --> 00:01:57.724
"It should be able to help us find sources of magic too," Zann said.

37
00:01:58.816 --> 00:02:03.257
"On Skellia the gulpers usually eat wormholes as soon as the wormholes appear.

38
00:02:03.577 --> 00:02:06.558
But the guidelink might help us find more wormholes.

39
00:02:07.158 --> 00:02:08.519
Then we can all get away."

40
00:02:09.719 --> 00:02:10.559
Darb nodded.

41
00:02:10.579 --> 00:02:12.540
"That's exactly what I was thinking."

42
00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:15.981
Zann smiled at him, impressed again.

43
00:02:16.661 --> 00:02:20.582
Darb didn't have any magic, but he was one of the smartest people Zann knew.

44
00:02:20.602 --> 00:02:24.704
"Do you think your parents would let us use the guidelink?"

45
00:02:25.004 --> 00:02:26.044
Gliss asked Zann.

46
00:02:27.132 --> 00:02:28.692
"No way," Zann replied.

47
00:02:28.712 --> 00:02:31.733
"Not if they knew we were planning to travel in the vortex.

48
00:02:32.113 --> 00:02:34.314
We'll have to take it from the lab without telling them."

49
00:02:35.414 --> 00:02:37.135
Zann felt bad saying that.

50
00:02:37.495 --> 00:02:39.295
He didn't want to deceive his parents.

51
00:02:40.356 --> 00:02:42.396
But they were so worried about other things.

52
00:02:43.336 --> 00:02:46.877
He didn't want to add to their worries now by telling them about Ello.

53
00:02:46.897 --> 00:02:52.019
"It's a good thing the adults are distracted by politics," Perda said.

54
00:02:52.039 --> 00:02:55.960
"We can probably rescue Ello and get back before they notice we're gone."

55
00:02:57.276 --> 00:02:58.577
Zann hoped she was right.

56
00:02:59.117 --> 00:03:04.099
Navigating the vortex was tricky, and they wouldn't have Wyssa to help them find their way home this

57
00:03:04.179 --> 00:03:06.600
time. Gliss looked out the window.

58
00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.241
"It's getting pretty late.

59
00:03:09.901 --> 00:03:14.143
Let's get a good night's sleep and then find an excuse to visit the lab in the morning."

60
00:03:21.286 --> 00:03:22.867
you going to the lab today?"

61
00:03:23.187 --> 00:03:25.588
Zann asked his parents and Boz at breakfast.

62
00:03:26.508 --> 00:03:30.831
He was nervous about how he and his friends would sneak the guidelink out of the lab.

63
00:03:30.851 --> 00:03:35.313
"Yes." Nax helped himself to a goofruit muffin.

64
00:03:35.333 --> 00:03:38.635
"We need to store the relics safely until after the election."

65
00:03:39.756 --> 00:03:44.159
"I still can't believe Laddno wants to be king," Boz said.

66
00:03:45.179 --> 00:03:48.241
Once again the adults started talking about politics.

67
00:03:49.402 --> 00:03:53.696
A few minutes later, Perda and Gliss arrived with Saffa.

68
00:03:53.716 --> 00:03:54.656
"Ready to get to work?"

69
00:03:54.897 --> 00:03:56.437
Saffa asked the other adults.

70
00:03:56.457 --> 00:03:59.178
"Can we tag along?"

71
00:03:59.379 --> 00:04:00.059
Perda asked.

72
00:04:00.079 --> 00:04:02.280
"I'd love to see more of the lab."

73
00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:04.941
"Of course," Asta agreed.

74
00:04:04.961 --> 00:04:06.922
"You'll have to stay out of the way though.

75
00:04:06.942 --> 00:04:08.282
We have a lot to do."

76
00:04:11.484 --> 00:04:16.326
When everyone arrived at the lab, Perda and Gliss distracted the adults with questions.

77
00:04:17.246 --> 00:04:21.308
Meanwhile Zann and Darb slipped off to the room where the guidelink sat.

78
00:04:22.224 --> 00:04:24.145
Zann grabbed the device from the shelf.

79
00:04:24.165 --> 00:04:26.766
"Uh-oh. Someone's coming!"

80
00:04:26.966 --> 00:04:27.666
Darb whispered.

81
00:04:28.787 --> 00:04:30.247
Mari had just walked in.

82
00:04:30.668 --> 00:04:32.908
Zann tucked the guidelink into his pocket.

83
00:04:32.928 --> 00:04:37.390
"Sorry I missed your party, Zann," Mari said.

84
00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:40.031
"I had to do something with my family instead."

85
00:04:40.051 --> 00:04:42.712
"Oh, that's too bad," Zann said.

86
00:04:42.732 --> 00:04:43.713
"It was fun."

87
00:04:44.613 --> 00:04:46.794
Just then Zann's mother hurried over.

88
00:04:47.234 --> 00:04:48.355
She looked serious.

89
00:04:49.455 --> 00:04:51.356
Zann felt the guidelink in his pocket.

90
00:04:51.712 --> 00:04:53.053
Had she seen him take it?

91
00:04:53.954 --> 00:04:55.475
But Asta was looking at Mari.

92
00:04:55.495 --> 00:04:57.176
"I'm glad you're here, Mari.

93
00:04:57.516 --> 00:04:58.457
We need your help."

94
00:05:05.201 --> 00:05:06.402
Zann cleared his throat.

95
00:05:06.422 --> 00:05:09.064
"I guess we'll get out of your way then," he said.

96
00:05:09.945 --> 00:05:11.786
He shot his friends a meaningful look.

97
00:05:12.727 --> 00:05:15.749
His parents and Saffa barely seemed to notice his comment.

98
00:05:16.609 --> 00:05:20.312
But Boz looked up as Zann and his friends headed toward the door.

99
00:05:21.388 --> 00:05:22.889
"Hold on," Boz said.

100
00:05:22.909 --> 00:05:25.189
"I'll zap home with you.

101
00:05:25.629 --> 00:05:27.930
I have some work to take care of at the house."

102
00:05:29.170 --> 00:05:29.951
Zann gulped.

103
00:05:29.971 --> 00:05:31.831
"Um, you're coming home now?

104
00:05:32.311 --> 00:05:33.452
But you just got here."

105
00:05:34.432 --> 00:05:35.932
Nax heard him and looked over.

106
00:05:35.952 --> 00:05:38.073
"It's better if your grandfather is with you.

107
00:05:38.773 --> 00:05:42.855
These are unsettled times in First City, and there's safety in numbers."

108
00:05:43.895 --> 00:05:44.735
Zann sighed.

109
00:05:45.275 --> 00:05:47.216
This wasn't part of their plan!

110
00:05:48.212 --> 00:05:52.355
How were they supposed to sneak away from Boz long enough to get to a wormhole?

111
00:05:53.295 --> 00:05:56.857
Boz was already rubbing his hands together, preparing to zap away.

112
00:05:57.478 --> 00:05:59.559
Just then Mari approached Darb.

113
00:05:59.579 --> 00:06:03.081
"I almost forgot," she said, smiling at him.

114
00:06:03.101 --> 00:06:06.463
"I heard about a Void Rights meeting that's happening today.

115
00:06:07.143 --> 00:06:10.125
People will be talking about some new breakthroughs in magic sharing."

116
00:06:10.145 --> 00:06:12.266
"Magic sharing?"

117
00:06:12.566 --> 00:06:13.327
Perda echoed.

118
00:06:14.367 --> 00:06:15.228
Mari nodded.

119
00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:18.703
"It's the future of equality for Voids," she explained.

120
00:06:18.723 --> 00:06:20.544
"You should go to the meeting, Darb!"

121
00:06:21.545 --> 00:06:25.369
"Um, I probably won't have time," Darb mumbled.

122
00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:28.591
"Here's the information, in case you change your mind."

123
00:06:29.212 --> 00:06:32.195
Mari told him when and where the meeting would be taking place.

124
00:06:33.215 --> 00:06:36.859
Then Saffa called her, and she went over to get instructions from her.

125
00:06:36.879 --> 00:06:38.540
"Ready, kids?"

126
00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:41.142
Magic was sparking from Boz's fingertips.

127
00:06:41.162 --> 00:06:42.684
"Let's zap!"

128
00:06:43.817 --> 00:06:47.507
Zann rubbed his own fingers together, trying to hide his dismay.

129
00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:51.238
How were they supposed to save Ello now?
